fact WorkItem(id: "WI-181", description: some(value: "WI-009 phase 2: read-only commands via KB.execute. The bundle status/list/show/graph/next stubs need to query the KB for WorkItem facts and format them. Pattern: build a LogicalQuery (sort_query(sort_name: anthill.stage0.WorkItem) or pattern_query(term: ...)), call execute(kb(), query) to get Stream of Substitution, iterate via splitFirst, extract fields. Several pieces are unproven from anthill code: 1. constructing a sort_query value with a String — straightforward entity literal; 2. obtaining a KB value — sort KB has entity kb in stdlib reflect, kb() should construct it; 3. iterating Stream via splitFirst — runtime support exists per anthill-core eval stream rs but no anthill-side example exercises it; 4. extracting field values from Substitution. Each command needs distinct query shapes: status counts by status field; list filters out delivered/verified by default; show retrieves one fact by id; graph builds a tree from depends_on; next runs the claimable rule from anthill-todo rules anthill. Acceptance: bundle status produces output structurally identical to legacy status against the same workitems file; cargo test green. Likely sub-WIs once exploration uncovers the actual blockers. Prerequisite for WI-009 phase 3 (mutating commands) since claim/deliver/verify need to FIND the existing WorkItem before retracting and re-asserting."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: nil), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Delivered(agent: "claude", at: "2026-05-20T10:46:34Z"))

fact Feedback(workitem: "WI-181", author: "claude", content: "Phase 2 read-only commands landed (status/list/show/graph) byte-identical to legacy. Foundation builtins: KB.facts_of (direct fact enumeration; sort_query lowers to is_entity_of which only yields entity declarations, not user facts — facts_of sidesteps the LogicalQuery machinery for the common case), Substitution.lookup (no kb param — pure read of subst bindings), term_functor_name / term_field / term_as_string (String-keyed term inspectors so anthill code skips Symbol construction), entity kb on sort KB, Int.to_string, String.toUpper/toLower. Bundle plumbing: run_anthill_bundle bulk-loads project's anthill-todo/ files, strips -d/--dir before parse_argv. cmd_show is byte-identical for ID/Description/Status/Depends on; Acceptance + Feedback rendering deferred (need TermPrinter + cross-fact iteration). cmd_next gated on anthill-side logical-variable construction (filed as WI-182 — needs reflect.fresh_var builtin so anthill can build pattern_query(claimable(?id, ?desc)) and run it via KB.execute). Perf follow-up filed as WI-183: 16s on 180 items dominated by O(N) linear scans in dependent/status lookups; needs Set/Map primitives or interpreter dispatch caches. Commits: 2abb25b (foundation + status + show), c8b03c1 (list), 08f02fb (graph). cargo test green throughout (anthill-core lib 176 + anthill-todo 7).", at: "2026-05-06T05:48:28Z")
